{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Three friends baked six cupcakes together.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.45,0.85],[0.93,1.22],[1.26,1.51],[1.59,2.15],[2.19,2.97]]},{"text":"Now it was time to share the cupcakes.","words":[[0,0.23],[0.3,0.4],[0.45,0.58],[0.66,0.94],[0.99,1.03],[1.09,1.36],[1.41,1.47],[1.54,2.65]]},{"text":"They wanted everyone to get the same amount.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.31,0.67],[0.77,1.31],[1.36,1.43],[1.49,1.64],[1.68,1.75],[1.83,2.17],[2.22,3.11]]},{"text":"They gave one cupcake to each friend.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.31,0.58],[0.66,0.89],[0.96,1.51],[1.53,1.6],[1.67,1.89],[1.97,2.83]]},{"text":"Then they gave one more cupcake to each friend.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.33,0.48],[0.53,0.8],[0.88,1.13],[1.18,1.41],[1.47,2.06],[2.1,2.17],[2.25,2.46],[2.53,3.39]]},{"text":"Now each friend had two cupcakes.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.34,0.56],[0.64,0.97],[1.04,1.21],[1.26,1.46],[1.56,2.6]]},{"text":"They counted to make sure it was fair.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.36,0.85],[0.89,0.94],[1.01,1.23],[1.29,1.53],[1.59,1.71],[1.76,1.93],[2.03,2.83]]},{"text":"Two, two, and two. Everyone had the same number.","words":[[0,0.55],[0.76,1.23],[1.28,1.54],[1.63,2.09],[2.61,3.15],[3.19,3.35],[3.4,3.47],[3.55,3.88],[3.95,4.74]]},{"text":"If one friend had more, they would move one to make it equal.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.34,0.61],[0.69,1.01],[1.08,1.25],[1.33,1.83],[2.04,2.24],[2.26,2.47],[2.55,2.89],[2.98,3.26],[3.31,3.4],[3.47,3.69],[3.74,3.83],[3.9,4.78]]},{"text":"They learned that sharing equally means everyone gets the same amount.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.69],[0.71,0.88],[0.97,1.49],[1.59,2.1],[2.18,2.61],[3,3.6],[3.66,3.92],[3.98,4.1],[4.18,4.5],[4.55,5.48]]}]}